      "parameters": {
        "content": "## INNOVIS TECHNOLOGIES — CRM WORKFLOW SETUP GUIDE\n\n1. **WhatsApp Credentials**:\n   - Set `phoneNumberId` and WhatsApp API credentials in the WhatsApp trigger & send nodes.\n\n2. **Supabase Setup**:\n   - Table `services`: Stores plans (Static ₹11,999, Full Stack ₹21,999, Full Stack + AI ₹39,999)\n   - Table `team_members`: Stores consultants (Name, Phone, Specialties)\n   - Table `leads`: Stores incoming leads & call summaries\n\n3. **Groq API**:\n   - Assign your Groq Credential to the LLM nodes (`llama-3.3-70b-versatile`).\n\n4. **LiveKit Voice Engine**:\n   - Set your LiveKit Server URL (`wss://your-project.livekit.cloud`) and HTTP Header Auth credentials.",
        "height": 480,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 7
      },
